 display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right\" columnspacing=\"\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mtable rowspacing=\"1em 1em 1em 1em 0.5em\" columnspacing=\"0.278em\" displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" rowlines=\"none solid none\"><mtr><mtd><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>3</mn><mi>s</mi></menclose><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>22</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p><p></p>\n<p></p><p>Therefore, the correct answer is the following:</p><p></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>Multiply the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"73\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 3.494em; margin: 0.3em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.3em; top: 0px; max-width: 3.494em;\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-mstyle></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"Gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+3pt\" depth=\"+3pt\" lspace=\"3pt\" width=\"+6pt\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mtext>second</mtext></mstyle></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> equation by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"74\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: gainsboro;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 1.878em; margin: 0.3em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.3em; top: 0px; max-width: 1.878em;\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"Gainsboro\"><mpadded height=\"+3pt\" depth=\"+3pt\" lspace=\"3pt\" width=\"+6pt\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mpadded></mstyle><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and add the equations</em>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div>",
